# Sarvam Maya

A local Flask-based AI chatbot powered by Groq and Llama 3.3 70B.

## Features

- Flask web application
- Llama 3.3 70B
- Groq API
- Secure `.env` API key configuration
- SQLite conversation history
- Multiple conversation threads
- New chat
- Delete conversations
- Markdown responses
- Conversation context
- Responsive UI

## Project Structure

```text
genai_flask_app/
